# armour-spells: the saved game the armour-spells session starts from. A new character, as the
# newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheats
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a scroll of Resist Blows (0x138, spell 1, armour
# level 2) and a scroll of Iron Flesh (spell 42, armour level 5), each as a level stores an
# enchanted scroll, into the pack. Saved in slot I, described "armour"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x138 1 40 spell 1
45000 cheat give 0x138 1 40 spell 42
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "armour"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key a
50700 key r
50900 key m
51100 key o
51300 key u
51500 key r
52000 key enter
